ainer\" data-settings=\"{&quot;sticky_logo_enable&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00fa2a3 sticky-heading-prefixstyle elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"00fa2a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">WHO WE ARE<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-72fb61b eael-dual-header-content-align-left eael-dual-header-content-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-dual-color-header\" data-id=\"72fb61b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-dual-color-header.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eael-dual-header\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"title eael-dch-title\"><span class=\"eael-dch-title-text elementor-repeater-item-67ae5f4\">Amplifying Diaspora Voices And Preserving<\/span> <span class=\"eael-dch-title-text elementor-repeater-item-83c38c3 eael-dch-title-gradient\">Collective Memory.<\/span> <\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subtext\"><p>Conspodium is more than a publication\u2014it&#8217;s a movement. A space where the journeys of Nigerians\u00a0 in the diaspora are captured, honored and shared.<\/p><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7fd0465 elementor-align-left sticky-ekit-buttonstyle elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-align--mobilecenter elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-button\" data-id=\"7fd0465\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;sa_floating_ef_enable&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\t\t<div class=\"ekit-btn-wraper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/conspodium.com\/submit-story\" class=\"elementskit-btn  whitespace--normal\" id=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\tSubmit Your Story<i class=\"jki jki-arrow-right-solid\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad32725 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ad32725\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;sticky_logo_enable&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4494660 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4494660\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;sticky_logo_enable&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9ebd914 eael-dual-header-content-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-dual-color-header\" data-id=\"9ebd914\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-dual-color-header.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eael-dual-header\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"title eael-dch-title\"><span class=\"eael-dch-title-text elementor-repeater-item-67ae5f4\">A Message from<\/span> <span class=\"eael-dch-title-text elementor-repeater-item-83c38c3 eael-dch-title-gradient\">Our Publisher<\/span> <\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subtext\"><p>To every Conspodium contributor: we extend our deepest gratitude. Thank you not just for your willingness to share, but for your unwavering belief in our vision.<\/p><p>We understand the realities of diaspora life\u2014demanding schedules, competing responsibilities, and precious creative time. Because of this understanding, we have evolved.<\/p><p>Your contributions are no longer confined to lengthy, polished articles. We now welcome diverse formats: voice notes, interviews, personal reflections, or even content you&#8217;ve already shared elsewhere. We&#8217;ve also moved from rigid deadlines to flexible content windows.<\/p><p>Your voice matters deeply, irrespective of its length or format. Conspodium&#8217;s essence lies not in speed, but in fostering meaning, celebrating authenticity, and preserving our collective memory as a diaspora.<\/p><p>This is a journey we are on together. We are committed to building Conspodium with you, not demanding from you.<\/p><p><em><strong>Ernest Ngadiuba<\/strong><\/em><br \/><em><strong>Publisher, Conspodium<\/strong><\/em><\/p><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-20c8ca7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"20c8ca7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;sticky_logo_enable&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de27947 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"de27947\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;sticky_logo_enable&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4b9646e eael-dual-header-content-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-dual-color-header\" data-id=\"4b9646e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-dual-color-header.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eael-dual-header\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"title eael-dch-title\"><span class=\"eael-dch-title-text elementor-repeater-item-67ae5f4\">What Defines<\/span> <span class=\"eael-dch-title-text elementor-repeater-item-83c38c3 eael-dch-title-gradient\">Us<\/span> <\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"subtext\"><p>We&#8217;re dedicated to telling the stories of diaspora communities worldwide, celebrating the richness of cultures that span continents and generations.<\/p><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21a94f6 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"21a94f6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;sticky_logo_enable&quot;:&quot;no&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f9b5e73 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"f9b5e73\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-center text- icon-top-align elementor-animation-   \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-header elementor-animation-\">\n                <div class=\"elementskit-info-box-icon  \">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementkit-infobox-icon icon icon-target-2\"><\/i>\n                <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                            <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n                    Our Mission                <\/h3>\n                        \t\t  \t<p>To provide a premium platform that amplifies the voices, stories, and achievements of diaspora communities worldwide. We believe every story deserves to be heard, and we're committed to publishing the narratives that shape our global culture with integrity, authenticity, and excellence.<\/p>\n                                <\/div>\n        \n        \n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c36b244 ekit-equal-height-enable elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-icon-box\" data-id=\"c36b244\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >        <!-- link opening -->\n                <!-- end link opening -->\n\n        <div class=\"elementskit-infobox text-center text- icon-top-align elementor-animation-   \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-box-header elementor-animation-\">\n                <div class=\"elementskit-info-box-icon  \">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementkit-infobox-icon far fa-eye\"><\/i>\n                <\/div>\n          <\/div>\n                        <div class=\"box-body\">\n                            <h3 class=\"elementskit-info-box-title\">\n                    Our Vision                <\/h3>\n                        \t\t  \t<p>To become the world's leading media platform for diaspora communities\u2014a trusted source where global citizens find inspiration, connection, and representation. We envision a world where diaspora stories are celebrated, not overlooked; where cultural identity is a source of pride and unity.<\/p>\n                                <\/div>\n        \n        \n                <\/div>\n        <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7608d09 elementor-blockquote--skin-quotation elementor-blockquote--align-center elementor-blockquote--button-color-official elementor-widget elementor-widget-blockquote\" data-id=\"7608d09\" data-element_type=\"wid