\t\t\t<div class=\"modal-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-team-modal-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"404\" height=\"512\" src=\"https:\/\/conspodium.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/unnamed.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2470\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/conspodium.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/unnamed.png 404w, https:\/\/conspodium.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/unnamed-237x300.png 237w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 404px) 100vw, 404px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-team-modal-info has-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"ekit-team-modal-title\">Hon. Carroll Igboanugo<\/h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"ekit-team-modal-position\">Board Member<\/p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-team-modal-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHon. Carroll Igboanugo is a distinguished communication strategist, political mobiliser, and philanthropist whose career has been defined by a singular conviction: that the Nigerian Diaspora possesses an immense, yet under-utilised, reservoir of soft power capable of reshaping national narratives and driving transformative development.\n\nA thoroughbred socio-political analyst with deep expertise in business administration and entrepreneurship, Carroll has spent over a decade operating at the intersection of Diaspora advocacy, political strategy, and grassroots empowerment. From her base in Ireland, she has consistently demonstrated that distance from the homeland is no barrier to meaningful impact \u2014 serving as a frontline mobiliser during the 2015 Goodluck Jonathan campaign, leading Worldwide Publicity for the Atiku\/Obi PDP Voice in Ireland during the 2019 electoral cycle, and emerging as a prominent vanguard of the Renewed Hope Agenda in support of President Bola Ahmed Tinubu.\n\nBeyond the political arena, Carroll is a passionate humanitarian who has quietly sponsored scholarships for underprivileged children, intervened in trafficking and juvenile welfare cases, and provided sustained support to women, the elderly, and vulnerable communities across Nigeria. Widely known as \"The People's Person,\" she embodies the citizenry diplomacy that Conspodium champions \u2014 the belief that every Diaspora voice carries weight and every act of service echoes across borders.\n\nCarroll joins the Conspodium Board with a formidable network spanning political corridors, business circles, and community organisations across Europe and Nigeria. Her proven capacity as a power broker, fund-raiser, and coalition builder makes her a strategic asset for amplifying the magazine's mission of documenting, celebrating, and leveraging Diaspora excellence. She brings not only influence but a deeply personal commitment to the idea that the stories of Nigerians abroad must be told, preserved, and deployed as instruments of national pride and global connection.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"ekit-team-modal-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Phone:<\/strong><a href=\"tel:+1 (859) 254-6589\">+1 (859) 254-6589<\/a><\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><strong>Email:<\/strong><a href=\"mailto:info@example.com\">info@example.com<\/a><\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-180693ef elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"180693ef\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\